! Reference deck for LLM test 05 (written for this test, not run).
! Quarter plate 100 x 100 mm with a 10 mm radius hole, 2 mm thick, 100 MPa
! tension in x. APDL has no RKPM, so this deck uses FEM for the same physical
! model. Plane stress with thickness. Units: mm, N, MPa.
/PREP7
ET,1,PLANE183
KEYOPT,1,3,3                 ! plane stress with thickness
R,1,2
MP,EX,1,70000
MP,PRXY,1,0.33
RECTNG,0,100,0,100
CYL4,0,0,10
ASBA,1,2
ESIZE,2
LSEL,S,RADIUS,,10
LESIZE,ALL,0.4
ALLSEL
AMESH,ALL
NSEL,S,LOC,X,0
D,ALL,UX,0
NSEL,S,LOC,Y,0
D,ALL,UY,0
ALLSEL
LSEL,S,LOC,X,100
SFL,ALL,PRES,-100            ! negative pressure: tension
ALLSEL
FINISH
/SOLU
ANTYPE,STATIC
SOLVE
FINISH
/POST1
NSEL,S,LOC,X,0
NSEL,R,LOC,Y,10
PRNSOL,S,COMP                ! expect SX near 300 MPa
ALLSEL
FINISH
